      "writtenOn": "2018-11-15T06:03:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "power_seq_version 0 is for Kevin/Bob/Gru (clamshell/convertible).\npower_seq_version 1 is for Scarlet rev0. Actually we can clean this up. \npower_seq_version 2 is for Scarlet rev1+.\n\nI think CONFIG_CHIPSET_POWER_SEQ_VERSION is still valuable because we can use this to support multiple different power sequences in one platform. A new config like CONFIG_CHIPSET_POWER_SEQ_TABLET can at most get us one additional power sequence for tablet.",
